# Phase 4 digest literals, composite version 1, recorded from the UNMODIFIED tree.
# Owning plan 05-03 (task 1, the first commit of the plan; D-18, V-19, A-09). These are the
# historical Phase 4 repeatability pins: values the emulator produced before any Phase 5 PSG
# storage existed. They are NEVER evidence of correctness. Plan 05-03 task 4 compares the
# re-blessed composite-version-2 goldens against them: digest.cpu and digest.images must be
# equal (the PSG storage must not perturb the CPU or the images); digest.mem, digest.instance
# and digest.composite are expected to differ (A-13), as is anything derived from them.
# Lines: <name> <hex>; test.stepped.N is domain N (0 = composite, 1..4 = cpu, mem, images, instance) of Content A loaded,
# power-on reset, 100 units through the step seam. Sources: tests/machine/machine_digest.c (md_fresh_composite, md_stepped;
# each confirmed by a passing run of build/dev/tests/ivs_tests_machine --only machine.digest.)
